===Etymology===
From {{inh|se|smi-pro|*nealjē}}, from {{inh|se|fiu-pro|*neljä}}. Cognates include Estonian {{term|neli|lang=et}}, Finnish {{term|neljä|lang=fi}}, and Hungarian {{term|négy|lang=hu}}.

